usage: benchmark_visual_cache_graphs.py [-h] [--config CONFIG]
                                        [--warmup WARMUP]
                                        [--graph-warmup GRAPH_WARMUP]
                                        [--reps REPS]
                                        [--include-partial-factor]
                                        [--include-temporal-control] --out-dir
                                        OUT_DIR

Measure only transformer graph dispatch, with equally graphed Dense controls.
All timings encompass full predict_action and CPU actions. Cold calls, capture
costs and model loading are reported separately from warmed rotating samples.
Every buffered/graphed output must be bitwise its own eager variant on every
request. No compile, fast math, RNG, scheduler or scientific-setting changes.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --warmup WARMUP
  --graph-warmup GRAPH_WARMUP
  --reps REPS
  --include-partial-factor
                        add matched Dense and guided variants with partial-
                        refresh capture enabled
  --include-temporal-control
                        compare full visual refresh against 10 percent with
                        all-transformer capture fixed
  --out-dir OUT_DIR
